      "content": "thanks for this. it's a good start but it needs to be more aggressive. they can't just ignore this. i need to prove that the 'industry' didn't just stumble onto this sound, they actively scouted my early setups and used their legal teams to bury my original compositions so they could claim the copyright for their own artists. it’s a systematic erasure. can you help me expand the section about the 'theft' to specifically target how these corporations use intellectual property law as a weapon to silence original visionaries like me?",
